DIC 1
# Labyrinth: the Wayfinder. Thread, chalk, lanterns, maps that may lie, riddle answers.
realm LABYRINTH
theme labyrinth
tab ALL
tab WAYFINDING
tab LIGHT
tab MAPS
tab WEAR
slot HAND
slot BELT
slot STRIDER
item THREAD_SPOOL WAYFINDING HAND EQUIP,INSPECT Thread Spool
detail THREAD_SPOOL Ari's thread. Unrolls behind you; follow it back.
item CHALK WAYFINDING - USE,DROP,SPLIT Chalk
detail CHALK Mark a wall. The Wallwright rubs it out at night.
item COMPASS WAYFINDING BELT EQUIP,INSPECT Humming Compass
detail COMPASS Hums louder near an exit. Lies near the Riddler.
item LANTERN LIGHT HAND EQUIP,INSPECT Lantern
detail LANTERN The Lantern Keeper's. Burns oil.
item LAMP_OIL LIGHT - USE,DROP,SPLIT Lamp Oil
detail LAMP_OIL One flask is one night.
item MAP_PARTIAL MAPS - INSPECT,DROP Partial Map
detail MAP_PARTIAL From the Lost Cartographer. Some of it is true.
item MAP_FALSE MAPS - INSPECT,DROP False Map
detail MAP_FALSE Also from the Cartographer. None of it is true. Sells well.
item RIDDLE_ANSWER MAPS - INSPECT Riddle Answer
detail RIDDLE_ANSWER The Echo Hermit's. One door, one answer.
item WAYFINDER_CLOAK WEAR BELT EQUIP,INSPECT Wayfinder's Cloak
detail WAYFINDER_CLOAK Pockets for chalk. Doesn't snag on thread.
item STRIDER_SADDLE WEAR STRIDER EQUIP,INSPECT Strider Saddle
detail STRIDER_SADDLE Oona's. The sky-strider carries you over the walls.
